WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.458
Hi, I'm Jack Lowden.

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:02.583
And I'm Olivia Cook.

00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:04.250
And in our new series,  
"Slow Horses,"  

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.041
we take you deep into 
the world of British Espionage. 

00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:09.416
It's not as slick, or as glamorous
as you might think, 

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:11.208
but it does have
a language of its own.

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:14.791
And we are going to test our skills 
in deciphering that code.

00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:16.375
Are you ready?
Because I'm ready. 

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.625
I am not ready.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.583
Bang And Burn.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:25.208
Is it when you quickly 
digest evidence

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:27.125
and then burn it
so no one sees it?

00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:28.375
Chat them up,
sleep with them

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:29.875
and then 
get outta there.

00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:32.541
- Demolition and sabatoge operations.
- Oh, of course.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.208
You're kidding, right?
Unbelievable.

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:36.791
A man that makes shoes.

00:00:36.791 --> 00:00:39.750
Shoe cobbler.
Cobbling evidence together?

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.416
- A tailer.
-A tailor?

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.583
Someone who tails,
and not a tailor of clothes.

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:46.583
A spy who creates false passports.

00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:47.916
Naked.

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:49.666
No alias.
Having no alias.

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:52.666
Is the target naked?
Is the target in clear view?

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:55.250
Is it an agent 
that looks good?

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.291
Particularly, looks good naked.

00:00:57.291 --> 00:00:58.500
A spy without operating...

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.125
That's probably the closest 
we've gotten. 

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:01.166
Next time.

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:02.125
A Bird Watcher.

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:03.750
A spy on the lookout,  

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.458
whose..

00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:05.875
-Someone high up.
-Yeah.

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:06.250
Surveillance.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.666
Someone that works 
specifically in surveillance.

00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:11.291
Slang used by British Intelligence
for a spy.

00:01:11.291 --> 00:01:12.833
Terrible.

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:14.125
Yeah, nailed that.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:15.666
Boy, you people are slow.

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:17.500
To find out more about spy words, 

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.208
and the people 
crazy enough to do it,

00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:21.875
watch "Slow Horses,"
coming soon to Apple TV+.

